# Royal City Labs — contact form delivery
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in ONE of the options below. With nothing set,
# the form still works: submissions are validated, logged and appended to
# `.data/leads.jsonl` (local prototype mode), and the success panel shows a
# developer note saying no delivery endpoint is configured yet.
#
# Priority order: CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL > RESEND_API_KEY + CONTACT_TO_EMAIL > local file.

# --- Option 1: webhook (Zapier, Make, n8n, Slack workflow, CRM endpoint) ---
# Receives the lead as a JSON POST:
# { name, email, company, industry, challenge, message, locale, submittedAt, source }
# CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.zapier.com/hooks/catch/000000/abcdef

# --- Option 2: email via Resend (https://resend.com — no SDK required) ---
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=contact@royalcitylabs.ca          # comma-separated for several recipients
# CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=Royal City Labs <no-reply@royalcitylabs.ca>   # must be a verified Resend domain
